de-nav sub" target="">Reporting Rules </a><a href="/cms/CmspageCategories/catalog/51" class="side-nav sub" target="">Reporting Forms </a></div></nav></div><div data-hover="" data-delay="0" class="sub-dd w-dropdown" data-ix="sub-accordion-interaction"><div class="side-nav sub-dd w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="sub-dd-icon w-icon-dropdown-toggle"></div><div>Procedures for the Offer of Securities </div></div><nav class="sub-dd-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="sub-dd-link-wrapper"><a href="/cms/CmspageCategories/catalog/44" class="side-nav sub" target="">Domestic Issuers</a><a href="/cms/CmspageCategories/catalog/45" class="side-nav sub" target="">Foreign Issuers</a><a href="/cms/CmspageCategories/catalog/46" class="side-nav sub" target="">Public</a><a href="/cms/CmspageCategories/catalog/47" class="side-nav sub" target="">Private</a></div></nav></div><a href="/cms/CmspageCategories/catalog/55" class="side-nav sub" target="">Guidance note for Reporting Issuers </a></div></nav></div><div class="single-link-wrap"><a href="/website_management/faqCategories/list_faqs" class="side-nav">Frequently Asked Questions</a></div>        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="main-ecsrc-info">
      	<h1 class="page-title">Registration Forms</h1><p>A company that wishes to issue securities to the public, must first be registered with the Eastern Caribbean Securities Regulatory Commission &uml;the ECSRC&uml;.<br /><br />Registration with the ECSRC is achieved by completing and submitting a Registration Form, Registration Statement RS-1, along with any required documents and fees. The requisite forms are contained within the Securities (Registration Statement) Rules. Please read the Rules which outline the required documents and the corresponding fees, which must be submitted along with the Registration Form.<br /><br />Companies are to use the form within the Securities (Registration Statement) Rules No. 2 of 2015. The rules for each country within the ECCU are as follows:</p>
<p><a title="Anguilla Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015" href="https://beta.ecsrc.com////img/source/Anguilla Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015.PDF">Anguilla Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015</a></p>
<p><a title="Antigua Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015" href="https://beta.ecsrc.com////img/source/Antigua Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015.pdf">Antigua Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015</a></p>
<p><a title="Dominica Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015" href="https://beta.ecsrc.com////img/source/Dominica Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015.PDF">Dominica Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015</a></p>
<p><a title="Grenada Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015" href="https://beta.ecsrc.com////img/source/Grenada Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015.PDF">Grenada Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015</a></p>
<p><a title="Montserrat Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015" href="https://beta.ecsrc.com////img/source/Montserrat Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015.pdf">Montserrat Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015</a></p>
<p><a title="St Kitts-Nevis Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015" href="https://beta.ecsrc.com////img/source/St Kitts-Nevis Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015.PDF">St Kitts-Nevis Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015</a></p>
<p><a title="St Lucia Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015" href="https://beta.ecsrc.com////img/source/St Lucia Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015.PDF">St Lucia Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015</a></p>
<p><a title="St Vincent Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015" href="https://beta.ecsrc.com////img/source/St Vincent Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015.pdf">St Vincent Securities (Registration Statement) Rules 2015</a>&nbsp;</p>              <div class="block">
                  <h3>Related Documents</h3>
                  <ul role="list" class="w-list-unstyled">
	                  					            <li>
					              <div class="mini-grid">
					                <div>
